Package: doubletrs
Title: Memory-Efficient Doublet Detection for Single-Cell RNA-seq
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mayank", "Gandhi", email = "gandhi.may@northeastern.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R bindings to 'doublet-rs', a Rust reimplementation of the
    'DoubletFinder' core engine: artificial doublet simulation,
    nearest-neighbour search, and pANN scoring.
